commit 90946129360b82951780d3cfe725896da0bc784d

C03: navigation reported as just done, never as a prior state; private CDP Edge without GPU acceleration (WEB1263 repair)

WEB1261: the navigation status hint («the page is already open… say so
in the past») made every final invent a prior state («La página ya estaba
abierta», «Ya estabas en YouTube»), and the GPU process of the product's
own Edge session pushed the process tree to 3874 MiB, over the 3800 MiB
budget, on one case. The hint now asks to report the navigation it just
made, invented_prior_open_state also rejects navigation replies that claim
the page was already open, and the private automation browser starts with
--disable-gpu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


diff --git a/src/Baxy.Providers.Windows/External/WebBrowserAdapter.cs b/src/Baxy.Providers.Windows/External/WebBrowserAdapter.cs
